  m_text: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs follows Flint Lockwood, a quirky young
    inventor in a struggling fishing town that only eats sardines. Flint builds a
    machine that turns water into food, making delicious meals rain from the sky.
    When the machine overloads and creates giant, destructive food storms, Flint
    must shut it down to save the world.
